WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,370 --> 00:00:01,330
Are you crazy?

2
00:00:01,330 --> 00:00:02,930
We have to go back before dawn

3
00:00:02,930 --> 00:00:04,170
It will be foggy here in the morning

4
00:00:04,170 --> 00:00:05,690
There will still be a period of time when the magnetic field pattern will be chaotic

5
00:00:05,690 --> 00:00:07,930
When the time comes, we won’t be able to move to Guanzhen Town, so let’s leave quickly.

6
00:00:20,250 --> 00:00:21,970
Brother Fu Chun, don’t panic first.

7
00:00:21,970 --> 00:00:23,290
Let me think about how to go

8
00:00:23,290 --> 00:00:24,690
How can you not panic?

9
00:00:24,690 --> 00:00:26,650
I still have a wife, daughter and children waiting for me at home.

10
00:00:26,650 --> 00:00:28,290
What should I do? How should I fix it?

11
00:00:28,290 --> 00:00:29,490
There's no use panicking at this time

12
00:00:29,490 --> 00:00:30,650
Which master is there?

13
00:00:30,650 --> 00:00:31,970
Come out and help me

14
00:00:31,970 --> 00:00:39,920
Brother Fu Chun, follow me closely

15
00:00:39,920 --> 00:00:40,840
I'll take you out

16
00:00:41,380 --> 00:00:43,420
There is light, that is the exit

17
00:00:45,470 --> 00:00:51,570
three hours

18
00:00:52,270 --> 00:00:53,790
Why do I feel like it’s been a long time?

19
00:00:54,230 --> 00:00:57,450
Stop thinking about it and go back quickly.

20
00:00:57,450 --> 00:00:59,490
What is there in the hidden mountains?

21
00:00:59,490 --> 00:01:01,130
Why is the magnetic field chaotic?
